@startuml
title 智颐养老系统 - 权限管理数据模型(RBAC)

skinparam class {
  BackgroundColor #FFF8F0
  BorderColor #D2691E
  FontSize 11
}

class SysUser {
  + Long userId
  + Long deptId
  + String userName
  + String nickName
  + String password
  + String phonenumber
  + String sex
  + String status
  + String delFlag
  + Date loginDate
}

class SysRole {
  + Long roleId
  + String roleName
  + String roleKey
  + Integer roleSort
  + String dataScope
  + String status
  + String delFlag
  + Set<String> permissions
}

class SysMenu {
  + Long menuId
  + String menuName
  + Long parentId
  + Integer orderNum
  + String path
  + String component
  + String menuType
  + String visible
  + String status
  + String perms
  + String icon
  + List<SysMenu> children
}

class SysDept {
  + Long deptId
  + Long parentId
  + String ancestors
  + String deptName
  + Integer orderNum
  + String leader
  + String status
  + List<SysDept> children
}

class SysPost {
  + Long postId
  + String postCode
  + String postName
  + Integer postSort
  + String status
}

class SysUserRole {
  + Long userId
  + Long roleId
}

class SysRoleMenu {
  + Long roleId
  + Long menuId
}

class SysRoleDept {
  + Long roleId
  + Long deptId
}

class SysUserPost {
  + Long userId
  + Long postId
}

SysUser "N" -- "N" SysRole : 通过 SysUserRole
SysUser "N" -- "N" SysPost : 通过 SysUserPost
SysRole "N" -- "N" SysMenu : 通过 SysRoleMenu
SysRole "N" -- "N" SysDept : 通过 SysRoleDept\n(数据权限)
SysDept "1" -- "N" SysUser : 所属部门

note right of SysRole
  dataScope 数据权限范围:
  1=仅本人
  2=本部门
  3=本部门及以下
  4=自定义
  5=全部数据
end note

note right of SysMenu
  menuType 类型:
  M=目录
  C=菜单
  F=按钮

  perms 权限标识:
  system:user:list
  system:user:add
  nursing:elder:list
  monitor:job:list
end note

note left of SysDept
  部门树形结构:
  - 中州养老(根节点)
    - 后勤部
    - 护理部(nursingId=201)
      - 一楼护理组
      - 二楼护理组
    - 市场部
end note

@enduml
